function u(n,...r){for(const e of r){const t=n[e];if(t!=null&&String(t).trim())return String(t).trim()}return""}function f(n,...r){for(const e of r){const t=n[e];if(t!=null&&t!==""){const o=Number(t);if(!Number.isNaN(o))return o}}return 0}async function s(n,r,e,t,o){if(!n)return 0;let a=0;for(const i of e){const c=t(i);if(c)try{await r.create(n,c,o),a++}catch{}}return a}export{f as a,s as b,u as e};
